## Provenance

All content is synthetic, produced by the generator in this repository from a
numeric seed. Kestrel Drive Systems, its customers, its suppliers, its products
and every person named in the documents are fictional. No real company data,
no personal data and no confidential material of any kind is present.

Resemblance to a real part number, order number or company name is a
consequence of drawing from plausible industrial naming conventions and is not
intended to reference any real entity.
